The inequality uses Lemma \ref{lemma:delta_bound_biased_expected} and the bound for $\norm{\nabla F(\cdot)}_\infty$. We denote $\frac{q_GR^2+Lq_WR\norm{\wb_{t-k-1}}_2}{\sqrt{\epsilon}} \triangleq M_{t-k}$.

